{"id":"55e78399bad5fbe9","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-subobject-classifier.md","title":"df-subobject-classifier","display":"df-subobject-classifier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-subobject-classifier","aliases":["16-df-subobject-classifier","Subobject classifier"],"display":"df-subobject-classifier","depends_on":["[[16-df-pullback-square]]","[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]"],"source":"Lemma 5.3.6, p. 335 (PDF 355); Definition 5.4.1(i), p. 339 (PDF 359)","revision_date":"2026-10-15"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-subobject-classifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-subobject-classifier</span><span>Subobject classifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subobject-classifier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemma 5.3.6, p. 335 (PDF 355); Definition 5.4.1(i), p. 339 (PDF 359)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为具有终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 与拉回的范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_S:S\\to1\">\\(!_S:S\\to1\\)</span> 为唯一终对象箭头。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(1,\\Omega)\">\\(\\top\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(1,\\Omega)\\)</span> 为候选分类数据。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(a,b;f,g)\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(a,b;f,g)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[m]\">\\([m]\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)\">\\(\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)\\)</span> 在下文定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:S\\xrightarrow{\\sim}T\">\\(c:S\\xrightarrow{\\sim}T\\)</span> 对集合表示双射；第二式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 是子对象同构类的特征映射。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall S,A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,A))\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\exists!\\chi\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,\\Omega))\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(m,!_S;\\chi,\\top)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall S,A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,A))\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\exists!\\chi\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,\\Omega))\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(m,!_S;\\chi,\\top)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\exists c:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,\\Omega))\\\\\n(\\forall S\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,A))\\\n\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(m,!_S;c([m]),\\top)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\exists c:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,\\Omega))\\\\\n(\\forall S\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,A))\\\n\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(m,!_S;c([m]),\\top)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>唯一特征态射的量词与拉回条件在同一公式体内。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}(m,!_S;\\chi,\\top)\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}(m,!_S;\\chi,\\top)\\)</span> 的四条边分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\to A\">\\(S\\to A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\to1\">\\(S\\to1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to\\Omega\">\\(A\\to\\Omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\to\\Omega\">\\(1\\to\\Omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>同构的单态射具有同一特征态射，因此映射下降到子对象同构类；反向将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 送到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span> 的拉回。拉回唯一性证明它们互逆。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Lemma 5.3.6, p. 335（PDF 第 355 页）及 Definition 5.4.1(i), p. 339（PDF 第 359 页）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}$、$\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(a,b;f,g)$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]；$\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)$ 与 $[m]$ 采用 [[16-df-subobject-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}$、$\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(a,b;f,g)$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]；$\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)$ 与 $[m]$ 采用 [[16-df-subobject-fibration]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"!_S:S\\to1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\top\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(1,\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(a,b;f,g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"[m]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"c:S\\xrightarrow{\\sim}T","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\forall S,A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,A))\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&\\qquad(\\exists!\\chi\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,\\Omega))\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(m,!_S;\\chi,\\top)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\exists c:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,\\Omega))\\\\\n(\\forall S\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,A))\\\n\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(m,!_S;c([m]),\\top)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PbSq}(m,!_S;\\chi,\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"S\\to1","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"1\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false}],"bytes":2328,"backlinks":[{"id":"3744a99e6a5c0037","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinLim}$、$\\mathrm{CCC}$、$\\mathrm{SubObjCl}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-ccc-definition]]、[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]。"},{"id":"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，选定分类单态 $\\top:1\\to\\Omega$，见 [[16-df-subobject-classifier]]。$\\chi_m$ 表示由该泛性质唯一确定的特征箭头；$!_A:A\\to1$ 为终态射。$\\mathrm{PbSq}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。"},{"id":"e3878d9cc72edc34","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 满足 [[16-df-nucleus]] 的 $\\mathrm{Nucleus}_\\Omega(j)$；$\\top:1\\to\\Omega$、$\\chi_m:A\\to\\Omega$ 采用 [[16-df-subobject-classifier]]。$\\top_A=\\top\\circ!_A$，$!_A$ 为唯一终态射。$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$。"},{"id":"dc7a86008fec71df","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 满足 [[16-df-nucleus]] 的 $\\mathrm{Nucleus}_\\Omega(j)$；$\\top:1\\to\\Omega$、$\\chi_m:A\\to\\Omega$ 采用 [[16-df-subobject-classifier]]。$\\top_A=\\top\\circ!_A$，$!_A$ 为唯一终态射。$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$。"},{"id":"d7c35c9db4abaffc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true})$ 满足 [[16-df-subobject-classifier]] 的 $\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true})$；其legacy拼写如下定义。"},{"id":"939ed0c717cef4ab","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]、[[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-pullback-square]]、[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]、[[16-df-nno]]、[[16-df-fibre]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-fibre-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]。"},{"id":"da4a5dccfe412249","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限积、子对象分类子和指数分别按 [[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]、[[16-df-ccc-definition]] 的泛性质理解。"},{"id":"26271d2146c7481f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt"